  <item>
    <title>单曲循环E03 Here With Me</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e291ef243baa2937239424</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e291ef243baa2937239424</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Mar 2025 11:28:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>地球电台，人类音乐，赛博回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Here With Me》- d4vd</span></p><span></span><p><span>Watch the sunrise</span></p><span></span><p><span>看朝阳</span></p><span></span><p><span>Along the coast</span></p><span></span><p><span>沿海岸升起</span></p><span></span><p><span>As we're both getting old</span></p><span></span><p><span>我俩年岁也增长</span></p><span></span><p><span>I can't describe</span></p><span></span><p><span>我无法形容</span></p><span></span><p><span>What I'm feeling</span></p><span></span><p><span>内心感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>And all I know</span></p><span></span><p><span>只知道</span></p><span></span><p><span>Is we're going home</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们要踏上归家路</span></p><span></span><p><span>So please don't let me go</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以请别让我走</span></p><span></span><p><span>Don't let me go</span></p><span></span><p><span>别松开我手</span></p><span></span><p><span>And if it's right</span></p><span></span><p><span>若没做错</span></p><span></span><p><span>I don't care how long it takes</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不在乎要花多久</span></p><span></span><p><span>As long as I'm with you</span></p><span></span><p><span>只要和你一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>I've got a smile on my face</span></p><span></span><p><span>我便会面带笑容</span></p><span></span><p><span>Save your tears it'll be ok</span></p><span></span><p><span>不必哭泣 一切会好起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>All I know is</span></p><span></span><p><span>我只知道</span></p><span></span><p><span>You're here with me</span></p><span></span><p><span>你与我同在</span></p><span></span><p><span>Watch the sunrise</span></p><span></span><p><span>看朝阳沿海岸升起</span></p><span></span><p><span>As we're getting old</span></p><span></span><p><span>我俩年岁也增长</span></p><span></span><p><span>I can't describe whoa</span></p><span></span><p><span>我无法形容内心感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>I wish I could live</span></p><span></span><p><span>我希望</span></p><span></span><p><span>Through every memory again</span></p><span></span><p><span>在你随风飘散前</span></p><span></span><p><span>Just one more time</span></p><span></span><p><span>重温一遍</span></p><span></span><p><span>Before we float off in the wind</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的每一块回忆碎片</span></p><span></span><p><span>And all the time we spent</span></p><span></span><p><span>追忆彼此共度的岁月</span></p><span></span><p><span>Waiting for the light</span></p><span></span><p><span>待光亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>To take us in</span></p><span></span><p><span>携你我去往</span></p><span></span><p><span>Have been the greatest</span></p><span></span><p><span>我生命里</span></p><span></span><p><span>Moments of my life</span></p><span></span><p><span>最美好的时光</span></p><span></span><p><span>I don't care how long it takes</span></p><span></span><p><span>不管要花多久</span></p><span></span><p><span>As long as I'm with you</span></p><span></span><p><span>只要和你一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>I've got a smile on my face</span></p><span></span><p><span>我便会面带笑容</span></p><span></span><p><span>Save your tears it'll be ok</span></p><span></span><p><span>不必哭泣 一切会好起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>Yeah if with me</span></p><span></span><p><span>你与我同在</span></p><span></span><p><span>I can't describe</span></p><span></span><p><span>我无法形容内心感受</span></p>]]></description>
